msgctxt "64"
msgid ""
"Purgatory used to belong to the bums, but it's Majima Family territory now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"They weren't so bad when they were building Kamurocho Hills, but now that "
"they're back in the Tojo Clan, they ain't gonna be putting up with anyone's "
"shit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid ""
"Heh. That's good to hear. It sounds like Majima-san hasn't changed one "
"bit..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"You'd be lucky to make it out alive after steppin' foot on their turf. If "
"you do plan on going there, you'd better be careful."
msgstr ""

